# default profile - everyday stack.
# Foundation (DB + proxy + containers) plus the services most people run
# 24/7: passwords (Vaultwarden), ai-agent (Hermes), cloud (Seafile),
# docs (Paperless), gallery (Immich), dev-agents (opencode/Flutter
# workstation).
#
# Disabled here because they are situational:
#   monitoring  - only needed when you want to watch resource usage
#   automation  - only needed when you actively run n8n workflows
#
# Resource note: dev-agents uses ~2 GB RAM at idle (Flutter SDK +
# Chromium). On a host with <8 GB RAM, disable it with
# `./manager.sh profile disable dev-agents` after switching to this
# profile.
monitoring
automation
